{"type":"message","id":"efd3f4e3","parentId":"f0b3c289","timestamp":"2026-04-02T09:19:15.574Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The issue is that Claude Code cannot connect to Anthropic's API. The error shows \"ERR_BAD_REQUEST\" which typically means the network connection itself is failing, not necessarily an authentication issue.\n\nThis could be a few things:\n1. Network connectivity issue - corporate firewall or proxy blocking\n2. API key not configured\n3. Geographic restriction\n\nLet me check if there are any proxy settings or network issues. Also, let me check if there's an API key environment variable that might be set.","thinkingSignature":"267edcd53564c297024e92ecdf383972e026f9c38c089bee102c6618d3ef08c2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ch2zk62yjc92_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo $env:ANTHROPIC_API_KEY; echo $env:CLAUDE_API_KEY; echo $env:API_KEY"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":3896,"output":150,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36880,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775121549764,"responseId":"061d678e830cfc9a765829199b53e760"}}
