{"type":"message","id":"537e7129","parentId":"90d90b2b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T09:20:29.597Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, that command would have set the env var and then run claude --version, but I don't actually have a valid API key to give them. Let me just explain the situation clearly - they need to run `claude login` in their own terminal to authenticate.","thinkingSignature":"88aa80af6b2d5083463f51acc8b3af593fb17299b0f3e1579837ffc41e675532"},{"type":"text","text":"你有 Anthropic API Key 吗？如果有的话，直接告诉我，我可以帮你配置上，这样就能直接用了。\n\n否则的话，你需要在**自己的终端**里运行一次 `claude login` 完成认证，之后我就能正常帮你启动 Claude Code 了。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":5448,"output":108,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38390,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775121623752,"responseId":"061d67d8511d8f72c745734f46fdf551"}}
